{"review_id": "6d60301d-c89a-4481-97a7-d22789a09d96", "package": "com.virblue.mystudylife", "app_name": "My Study Life - School Planner", "language": "ko", "language_name": "Korean", "rating": 5, "text": "I've been using this app since I was on Windows Phone. It doesn't have as many features as other paid apps, but I like that there are no ads, the app is lightweight, and it works well with my PC or Mac. The lack of Korean support is not a big drawback.", "author": "남윤성", "date": "2023-09-11T00:14:09Z", "thumbs_up": 1, "app_version": "6.2.8", "developer_reply": "Hearing that you've been a loyal MyStudyLife user for a long time is so exciting for us. We look forward to bringing you even more great features in the future and wish you the best of luck with your school year!"}
{"review_id": "d18557da-2577-45ed-8105-be19cf26e379", "package": "com.virblue.mystudylife", "app_name": "My Study Life - School Planner", "language": "ko", "language_name": "Korean", "rating": 2, "text": "아 위젯이 없네.. 다른건 다 만족인데 이앱도 탈락 타임태이블 어플 찾기 참힘들다", "author": "BK Min", "date": "2021-08-17T00:18:03Z", "thumbs_up": 0, "app_version": "6.2.7", "developer_reply": "안녕하세요 BK. 멋진 리뷰를 남겨 주셔서 대단히 감사합니다. 우리는 당신이 노력을 정말 감사합니다. 귀하의 제안은 정당하게 지적하고 우리가 우리의 다음 업데이트에 통합 할 수 있기를 바랍니다. 사랑을 전파하고 MyStudyLife에 대한 모든 친구에게 말하십시오!😊😊\n#HappyStudying"}
